      "text": "slow fast  nums[fast] != 0 \n           ->swap@slow&fast, slow++\n0     0    0!=0F,-\n0     1    1!=0T,nums=[1,0,0,3,12],slow=1\n1     2    0!=0F,-\n1     3    3!=0T,nums=[1,3,0,0,12],slow=2\n2     4    12!=0T,nums=[1,3,12,0,0],slow=3\n3     5    stop",
